Examples for the KIARA galaxy formation model:

 - MAGMA2 SPH,
 - KIARA cooling (built-in crackle: primordial and metal-line cooling,
   H2, dust formation and destruction, interstellar radiation field),
 - KIARA chemistry (11 elements, metal diffusion, firehose wind mixing),
 - KIARA star formation and stellar feedback (chem5 yields, decoupled
   kinetic winds),
 - Obsidian black holes (Rennehan et al. 2024).

Shared files:

 - chem5/             chem5 stellar lifetime and yield tables (KIARAFeedback:tables_path)
 - getCloudyTable.sh  fetches the Cloudy table used by the cooling (KIARACooling:cloudy_table)
 - rt_tables/         KIARA-RT tables (only needed with --with-subgrid=KIARART
                      and --with-rt=KIARA_<N>):
     BPASS_chab100_fuv.h5         stellar photon tables per photon group
                                  (FUV, HI, HeI, HeII), BPASS Chabrier IMF to
                                  100 Msun (KIARART:stellar_table_path, with
                                  KIARART:stellar_luminosity_model: BPASS).
                                  Groups are read by name, so the same file
                                  serves builds with or without the FUV group.
                                  Made with tools/make_kiara_rt_bpass_tables.py.
     kiara_rt_agn_qsosed_v2.hdf5  AGN spectral shares per photon group, and the
                                  AGN hard group's cross sections and mean
                                  photon energy, from qsosed (Kubota & Done
                                  2018), for the photon groups
                                  [1.451e15, 3.288e15, 5.945e15, 13.157e15] Hz
                                  (BlackHoles:rt_agn_table_path, with
                                  BlackHoles:rt_agn_emission: 1). Made with
                                  tools/make_kiara_rt_agn_table.py.

Star particle luminosities (the Luminosities output) are only computed if
Stars:luminosity_filename points to the EAGLE photometry tables (see
../EAGLE_ICs/getEaglePhotometryTable.sh); the examples do not set it.

Examples:

 - KIARA_25/          EAGLE 25 Mpc ICs at low resolution (L0025N0188), with the
                      current KIARA calibration.
 - KIARA_RT/          The same ICs and calibration with radiative transfer
                      (KIARA-RT), to z=6.
